  "description": "OpenExcelLite: Minimal, dependency-free Excel generator.\n\t\t\tFeatures include streaming (100k–1M+ rows), hyperlink support, tables, AutoFilter, autofit columns,\n\t\t\tcorrect date formatting, empty row handling, and fully schema-valid OpenXML output.\n\t\t\tNo ClosedXML. No EPPlus. No interop. Production-grade performance.",
